        "y0": 0.8198295454545454,
        "x1": 0.8088267973856209,
        "y1": 0.851729797979798
      },
      "text": "In this section, we derive the PDF of the ratio 𝑍 = 𝑋1/𝑋2, where 𝑋1 and 𝑋2 are two correlated Gamma-distributed random variables with the same shape and scale parameters.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
